<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Motorola as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- McDonald &amp; Co said analyst Chuck Thomas initiated coverage of Motorola Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We like the company's longer-term prospects, but the next several quarters appear challenging at best,&quot; Thomas said in a brief research note.</p>
<p>-- does not expect favorable earnings comparison until the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- estimates earnings of $2.08 per share for 1996, and $2.95 for 1997, versus $2.92 for 1995.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1-1/8 to 49-3/4.</p>
</text>
